<title>NEW ZEALAND: RBNZ changes weightings in NZ Trade-Weighted Index.</title>
<headline>RBNZ changes weightings in NZ Trade-Weighted Index.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand said on Wednesday it had changed the weightings in the New Zealand dollar Trade-Weighted Index.</p>
<p>The bank detailed the new weightings as follows -</p>
<p>		  USD	  AUD	 JPY	GBP	DEM</p>
<p>New weighting 21.52	37.80     24.82    9.88     5.98</p>
<p>Previous	21.87	37.14     24.91    9.93     6.15</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
